   "id": "M1:T13",
   "speaker": "Client",
   "act": "state",
   "guide": "The speaker states the content in their own words.",
   "content": [
    {
     "text": "A governing model has to be defined in order to deploy the infrastructure, to maintain its state and sustainability over time.",
     "role": "statement"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "M1:T14",
   "speaker": "Client",
   "act": "state",
   "guide": "The speaker states the content in their own words.",
   "content": [
    {
     "text": "Maintainability: The mapping has to be easily maintainable which could be of interest in the case of changes of the legal basis on national or European level. A formal procedure has to be found how changes are applied to the system. Moreover an organisation or institution that governs the process of change management has to be defined.",
     "role": "statement"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "M1:T15",
   "speaker": "Analyst",
   "act": "backchannel",
   "guide": "Short acknowledgment while listening (1-3 words)."
  },
  {
   "id": "M1:T16",
   "speaker": "Analyst",
   "act": "ask_topic",
   "guide": "Analyst moves the discussion to the topic 'accessibility of mapping facility' and asks about it."
  },
  {
   "id": "M1:T17",
   "speaker": "Client",
   "act": "state",
   "guide": "The speaker states the content in their own words.",
   "content": [
    {
     "text": "Therefore each national service provider that provides a VCD (stage 2-4) and all relevant key other stakeholder such as economic operators, contracting authorities and certifiers must be able to retrieve the latest mapping information from the mapping facility.",
     "role": "statement"
    }
   ]
  },
